ynamicAttributeValue\\(String attrPath, Object value\\)#{4}":[669,669],"#GlideDynamicAttributeStore- Global#GlideDynamicAttributeStore - setDynamicAttributeValue\\(String attrPath, Object value\\)#{5}":[670,670],"#GlideDynamicAttributeStore- Global#GlideDynamicAttributeStore - setDynamicAttributeValue\\(String attrPath, Object value\\)#{6}":[671,671],"#GlideDynamicAttributeStore- Global#GlideDynamicAttributeStore - setDynamicAttributeValue\\(String attrPath, Object value\\)#{7}":[672,672],"#GlideDynamicAttributeStore- Global#GlideDynamicAttributeStore - setDynamicAttributeValue\\(String attrPath, Object value\\)#{8}":[673,674],"#GlideDynamicAttributeStore- Global#GlideDynamicAttributeStore - setDynamicAttributeValue\\(String attrPath, Object value\\)#{9}":[675,724],"#GlideDynamicAttributeStore- Global#GlideDynamicAttributeStore - setDynamicAttributeValues\\(Object value\\)":[725,754],"#GlideDynamicAttributeStore- Global#GlideDynamicAttributeStore - setDynamicAttributeValues\\(Object value\\)#{1}":[727,754],"#GlideDynamicAttributeStore- Global#GlideDynamicAttributeStore - setDynamicNamespace\\(String namespaceName\\)":[755,786],"#GlideDynamicAttributeStore- Global#GlideDynamicAttributeStore - setDynamicNamespace\\(String namespaceName\\)#{1}":[757,786],"#GlideDynamicAttributeStore- Global#GlideDynamicAttributeStore - setValue\\(Object value\\)":[787,847],"#GlideDynamicAttributeStore- Global#GlideDynamicAttributeStore - setValue\\(Object value\\)#{1}":[789,847],"#GlideDynamicAttributeStore- Global#GlideDynamicAttributeStore - toString\\(\\)":[848,895],"#GlideDynamicAttributeStore- Global#GlideDynamicAttributeStore - toString\\(\\)#{1}":[850,895]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Dynamic schema","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/dynamic-schema.md","line":26},{"title":"GlideRecord","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_GlideRecordAPI.md","line":30},{"title":"GlideAggregate - Global","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_GlideAggregateAPI.md","line":32},{"title":"GlideRecord - Global","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_GlideRecordAPI.md","line":43},{"title":"GlideDynamicAttributeStore - Global","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/GlideDynamicAttStoreAPI.md","line":61},{"title":"GlideDynamicNamespace - Global","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/GlideDynamicNamespaceAPI.md","line":62},{"title":"GlideElement - Global","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_GlideElementAPI.md","line":63},{"title":"GlideElementDynamicAttributeStore - Global","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/GlideElementDynamicAttStoreAPI.md","line":64},{"title":"Server API reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/api-server.md","line":66},{"title":"GlideDynamicAttribute","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/GlideDynamicAttributeAPI.md","line":241},{"title":"GlideDynamicAttributeStore - setValue\\(Object value\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/GlideDynamicAttStoreAPI.md","line":442},{"title":"GlideDynamicAttributeStore - setDynamicAttributeValue\\(String attrPath, Object value\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/GlideDynamicAttStoreAPI.md","line":520},{"title":"GlideDynamicAttributeStore - setDisplayValue\\(Object value\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/GlideDynamicAttStoreAPI.md","line":791}],"metadata":{"title":"GlideDynamicAttributeStore - Global","description":"Use the GlideDynamicAttributeStore API to create objects for working with dynamic attributes independently of a table or field.Clears all attributes and their values from the GlideDynamicAttributeStore object.Returns the JSON map representation of the values stored in the current GlideDynamicAttributeStore object.Returns dynamic attribute object located at a specified dynamic attribute path.Returns the set of dynamic attribute definitions present in the store.Returns the value of the specified attribute within the dynamic attribute store element.Returns the dynamic namespace.Returns the compact string representation of the contents of the current GlideDynamicAttributeStore object.Clears the current GlideDynamicAttributeStore object and then stores the passed JSON map in the GlideDynamicAttributeStore object.Sets the value of the dynamic attribute located at a specified path within a dynamic attribute store element.Sets the dynamic attribute referenced by a specified attribute path to a specified value.Sets the internal JSON storage for the field to the String representation of the passed value. If the passed value is another instance of a GlideDynamicAttributeStore object, it copies the values from that object to the current object.Sets a dynamic namespace name.Clears the current GlideDynamicAttributeStore object and then stores the passed JSON map in that GlideDynamicAttributeStore object.Returns the content of the GlideDynamicAttributeStore object as a string.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-referenc